<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Sweet Crumbs Bakery - Toko roti modern dengan berbagai pilihan roti dan pastry lezat.">
    <title>Sweet Crumbs Bakery</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fffaf5;
            color: #3d2921;
        }

        /* NAVBAR */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 18px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(255, 250, 245, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #a6532c;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #e49a55;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #3d2921;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #c66a36;
        }

        /* HERO */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 140px 8% 70px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff4e7, #ffe0bd);
        }

        .hero-text {
            max-width: 580px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            background: #fff;
            color: #b65e32;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 75px);
            line-height: 1.05;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #c76735;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #70584c;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 25px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #a6532c;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(166,83,44,0.3);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            border: 2px solid #a6532c;
            color: #a6532c;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: #a6532c;
            color: white;
        }

        .hero-image {
            width: min(480px, 100%);
            height: 480px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #d9904e, #8d4428);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 180px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(100,50,20,0.25);
        }

        /* SECTION */
        section {
            padding: 90px 8%;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .section-title small {
            color: #c76735;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        /* PRODUCTS */
        .products {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 22px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(80,40,20,0.08);
            transition: 0.3s;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 35px rgba(80,40,20,0.15);
        }

        .product-img {
            height: 190px;
            border-radius: 17px;
            background: #f4d1a8;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 85px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #806b5f;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .price {
            color: #b55c31;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* PROMO */
        .promo {
            background: #3d2921;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 55px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .promo h2 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .promo p {
            color: #e8d5c8;
        }

        .promo .btn {
            background: #e49a55;
            color: #3d2921;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        /* ABOUT */
        .about {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .about-box {
            background: #f4d1a8;
            min-height: 350px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 120px;
        }

        .about h2 {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .about p {
            color: #70584c;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .features {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .feature {
            padding: 12px 17px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* CONTACT */
        .contact {
            text-align: center;
            background: #fff0df;
        }

        .contact-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 25px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .contact-item {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            background: #3d2921;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        footer p {
            color: #d9c6bb;
        }

        /* RESPONSIVE */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .buttons {
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .hero-image {
                width: 330px;
                height: 330px;
                font-size: 120px;
            }

            .products {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .about {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .promo {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            nav {
                padding: 15px 5%;
            }

            nav ul {
                display: none;
            }

            section {
                padding: 70px 5%;
            }

            .products {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .hero {
                padding-left: 5%;
                padding-right: 5%;
            }

            .promo {
                padding: 35px 25px;
            }

            .promo h2 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Sweet<span>Crumbs</span> 🥐</div>

        <ul>
            <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#produk">Produk</a></li>
            <li><a href="#tentang">Tentang</a></li>
            <li><a href="#kontak">Kontak</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-text">
            <div class="badge">✨ Fresh From The Oven</div>

            <h1>
                Roti Lezat,<br>
                <span>Hari Lebih Nikmat.</span>
            </h1>

            <p>
                Nikmati berbagai roti dan pastry fresh yang dibuat
                dengan bahan berkualitas dan penuh rasa.
            </p>

            <div class="buttons">
                <a href="#produk" class="btn btn-primary">
                    Lihat Produk →
                </a>

                <a href="#kontak" class="btn btn-secondary">
                    Hubungi Kami
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-image">
            🥐
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRODUK -->
    <section id="produk">

        <div class="section-title">
            <small>MENU FAVORIT</small>
            <h2>Produk Pilihan Kami</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="products">

            <div class="card">
                <div class="product-img">🍞</div>
                <h3>Roti Milk</h3>
                <p>Roti lembut dengan rasa susu yang creamy.</p>
                <div class="price">Rp8.000</div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="product-img">🥐</div>
                <h3>Croissant</h3>
                <p>Croissant renyah dengan tekstur berlapis.</p>
                <div class="price">Rp12.000</div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="product-img">🍩</div>
                <h3>Donat Cokelat</h3>
                <p>Donat lembut dengan topping cokelat.</p>
                <div class="price">Rp7.000</div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="product-img">🧁</div>
                <h3>Cupcake</h3>
                <p>Cupcake lembut dengan cream yang manis.</p>
                <div class="price">Rp10.000</div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROMO -->
    <section>
        <div class="promo">
            <div>
                <h2>Promo Hari Ini! 🎉</h2>
                <p>
                    Beli 3 roti favoritmu dan dapatkan potongan harga spesial.
                </p>
            </div>

            <a href="#kontak" class="btn">
                Pesan Sekarang
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TENTANG -->
    <section id="tentang">

        <div class="about">

            <div class="about-box">
                🍰
            </div>

            <div>
                <small>KENAPA SWEET CRUMBS?</small>

                <h2>Dibuat dengan kualitas dan rasa terbaik.</h2>

                <p>
                    Sweet Crumbs Bakery menghadirkan roti fresh setiap hari.
                    Kami menggunakan bahan berkualitas untuk menghasilkan
                    roti yang lembut, lezat, dan cocok dinikmati kapan saja.
                </p>

                <div class="features">
                    <div class="feature">🍞 Fresh</div>
                    <div class="feature">⭐ Berkualitas</div>
                    <div class="feature">❤️ Dibuat dengan cinta</div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- KONTAK -->
    <section class="contact" id="kontak">

        <div class="section-title">
            <small>CONTACT US</small>
            <h2>Pesan Roti Favoritmu</h2>
        </div>

        <p>
            Hubungi kami untuk pemesanan atau informasi lebih lanjut.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-info">

            <div class="contact-item">
                📱 WhatsApp<br>
                <strong>0812-3456-7890</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="contact-item">
                📍 Lokasi<br>
                <strong>Mojokerto, Jawa Timur</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="contact-item">
                🕐 Buka<br>
                <strong>07.00 - 21.00</strong>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Sweet Crumbs Bakery. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
